 AI teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant positions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI/ML Intern"},{"text":"Machine Learning Intern"},{"text":"Data Science Intern"},{"text":"AI Research Intern"},{"text":"Computer Vision Intern"},{"text":"NLP Intern"},{"text":"GenAI Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Python Developer Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The best internship is one where the student works with real datasets, models and production code."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After the trainee stage, possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI/ML Trainee"},{"text":"Machine Learning Engineer"},{"text":"Junior ML Engineer"},{"text":"AI Engineer"},{"text":"Applied AI Engineer"},{"text":"Junior Data Scientist"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Data Scientist"},{"text":"Computer Vision Engineer"},{"text":"NLP Engineer"},{"text":"GenAI Engineer"},{"text":"ML Operations Associate"},{"text":"AI Software Engineer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Not every BCA graduate will directly enter an ML Engineer role. Strong mathematics, projects and internship experience can significantly improve the transition."}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"AI Startup"},{"text":"Python + ML + APIs + GenAI"}],[{"text":"Product Company"},{"text":"ML + software engineering"}],[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"ML + statistics + SQL"}],[{"text":"HealthTech"},{"text":"ML + data + domain knowledge"}],[{"text":"Computer Vision Company"},{"text":"OpenCV + deep learning"}],[{"text":"GenAI Startup"},{"text":"LLMs + RAG + Python"}],[{"text":"Analytics Company"},{"text":"SQL + statistics + ML"}],[{"text":"IT Services"},{"text":"Python/Java + ML + cloud"}],[{"text":"Research Lab"},{"text":"Mathematics + ML + research"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifica