L Engineer","AI Lead / ML Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA AI/ML","strong Python and mathematics","SQL","classical ML","deep learning","one AI specialization","deployed projects","internship","basic MLOps"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The most important transition is from “I know machine-learning algorithms” to “I can take a real dataset, build and evaluate a model, expose it through an API, deploy it, monitor it and explain its business value.” That is what turns a BCA AI/ML graduate into a strong AI/ML trainee candidate."}]}]}